(7267865, 1130855, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Soft tones and just enough sharpness on the edges of the petals to highlight them.</td>', 'Nicely done. Soft tones and just enough sharpness on the edges of the petals to highlight them.', '2014-09-30 22:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
