(7267916, 1130852, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent - I like the way they''ve all curled in different ways, and the surface below the blade and the shadow on it are delightful.</td>', 'Excellent - I like the way they''ve all curled in different ways, and the surface below the blade and the shadow on it are delightful.', '2014-09-30 23:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267917, 1130854, 13077, '<td valign="top">Yikes, that''s certainly a long drop. Nicely exposed and composed, full of edges too.</td>', 'Yikes, that''s certainly a long drop. Nicely exposed and composed, full of edges too.', '2014-09-30 23:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267918, 1130865, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this - the light parts are flirting with white nothingness and the dark parts start out as a simple wall in shadow and become a lot more interesting as you look up.</td>', 'I like this - the light parts are flirting with white nothingness and the dark parts start out as a simple wall in shadow and become a lot more interesting as you look up.', '2014-09-30 23:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267919, 1130771, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice - lots of edges that aren''t found a whole lot in nature.</td>', 'Nice - lots of edges that aren''t found a whole lot in nature.', '2014-09-30 23:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267920, 1130675, 13077, '<td valign="top">Gator? I don''t see it. But the leaf is well photographed.</td>', 'Gator? I don''t see it. But the leaf is well photographed.', '2014-09-30 23:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267921, 1130647, 13077, '<td valign="top">It has edges, but I don''t know if this was the best angle to shoot it from.</td>', 'It has edges, but I don''t know if this was the best angle to shoot it from.', '2014-09-30 23:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267922, 1130770, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured layers of ever-more-distant cliffs, with some foreground edges to ground it all. I might have moved around and chosen a tree that could be included all the way in the composition instead of cropping the top out, though.</td>', 'Nicely captured layers of ever-more-distant cliffs, with some foreground edges to ground it all. I might have moved around and chosen a tree that could be included all the way in the composition instead of cropping the top out, though.', '2014-09-30 23:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267923, 1130830, 13077, '<td valign="top">The light as it interacts with the books and the wooden shelf is very interesting, and the reflections of the books are as well.</td>', 'The light as it interacts with the books and the wooden shelf is very interesting, and the reflections of the books are as well.', '2014-09-30 23:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267924, 1130886, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Good concept and very well done.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Good concept and very well done.', '2014-09-30 23:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267925, 1130388, 13077, '<td valign="top">From this angle it really looks like a tidal wave coming to sweep them away. I like the title.</td>', 'From this angle it really looks like a tidal wave coming to sweep them away. I like the title.', '2014-09-30 23:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267926, 1130856, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wonder what it would have looked like with a curves layer darkening the sky, but gradually applied with a mask?</td>', 'Wonder what it would have looked like with a curves layer darkening the sky, but gradually applied with a mask?', '2014-09-30 23:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267927, 1130783, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and sharpness here, and the composition is fascinating. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Excellent colors and sharpness here, and the composition is fascinating. I like it a lot.', '2014-09-30 23:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267928, 1130807, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice - clean composition, good angle and very sharp details.</td>', 'Nice - clean composition, good angle and very sharp details.', '2014-09-30 23:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267929, 1130510, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice - the composition is very good, I like the little slice of sharpness but still being able to see the other lettering.</td>', 'Nice - the composition is very good, I like the little slice of sharpness but still being able to see the other lettering.', '2014-09-30 23:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267930, 1130864, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the layer of darkness encroaching on the man in the water here. Nice tones as well.</td>', 'I like the layer of darkness encroaching on the man in the water here. Nice tones as well.', '2014-09-30 23:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267931, 1130861, 13077, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the composition of this one. Maybe shooting from another angle might have revealed something more interesting for a background. Also there seems to be some motion blur, even the focused edge doesn''t look all the way sharp.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the composition of this one. Maybe shooting from another angle might have revealed something more interesting for a background. Also there seems to be some motion blur, even the focused edge doesn''t look all the way sharp.', '2014-09-30 23:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267932, 1130628, 13077, '<td valign="top">The first thing I see is the multicolored grain. Since the color isn''t really providing much to the photo in this case, might have been easier on the eyes as a B&amp;W conversion.</td>', 'The first thing I see is the multicolored grain. Since the color isn''t really providing much to the photo in this case, might have been easier on the eyes as a B&W conversion.', '2014-09-30 23:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267934, 1130782, 13077, '<td valign="top">Huh?<br/>I feel like I''m missing out on a cool concept, because the image illustrating it is certainly cool. Nice colors and light/shadow play in the out-of-focus background.</td>', 'Huh?I feel like I''m missing out on a cool concept, because the image illustrating it is certainly cool. Nice colors and light/shadow play in the out-of-focus background.', '2014-09-30 23:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267935, 1130637, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept and well lit and composed.</td>', 'Excellent concept and well lit and composed.', '2014-09-30 23:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267936, 1130860, 13077, '<td valign="top">Full of edges, and a nice shot of a beautiful old car. I like that there are no people reflected in the bumper, but the reflections in the strips on the side couldn''t be helped. Nice detail shot, though.</td>', 'Full of edges, and a nice shot of a beautiful old car. I like that there are no people reflected in the bumper, but the reflections in the strips on the side couldn''t be helped. Nice detail shot, though.', '2014-09-30 23:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267937, 1130329, 13077, '<td valign="top">Yes it sure does. I''ll have to check back and see what this is.</td>', 'Yes it sure does. I''ll have to check back and see what this is.', '2014-09-30 23:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267938, 1130766, 13077, '<td valign="top">Yep - gotta be the most edges-per-square-inch of anything alive.</td>', 'Yep - gotta be the most edges-per-square-inch of anything alive.', '2014-09-30 23:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
